" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"插图\"></svg></section><section style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: 80px; align-self: center; flex: 0 0 auto; height: auto; margin: 0px 3px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 0; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%; vertical-align: middle; display: inline-block; line-height: 0; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img __bg_gif\" data-ratio=\"0.34234234234234234\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/88TGxxzdAAfJ2t2cQ6NCiatAyQuBtbPKLpQiciaB0WZxvOT2NqvhYibgmOrLoiaQ9PBg7taTJzwzEEblI0RvTbl07dQ/640?wx_fmt=gif#imgIndex=1\" data-w=\"222\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; max-width: 100%; width: 80px !important; box-sizing: border-box; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;\" width=\"100%\" data-original-style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-index=\"4\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/88TGxxzdAAfJ2t2cQ6NCiatAyQuBtbPKLpQiciaB0WZxvOT2NqvhYibgmOrLoiaQ9PBg7taTJzwzEEblI0RvTbl07dQ/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=1\" _width=\"100%\" data-order=\"1\" alt=\"图片\" data-report-img-idx=\"1\" data-fail=\"0\"></section></section></section><section style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: auto; align-self: center; flex: 100 100 0%; height: auto; border-bottom: 2px solid rgb(232, 87, 83); box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 1 1\" style=\"float: left; line-height: 0; width: 0px; vertical-align: top; visibility: visible;\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"插图\"></svg></section></section><section style=\"text-align: justify; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\">近年来，知识产权案件愈发增多，越来越多的企业开始重视知识产权的保护。品牌是企业竞争发展的护城河，为了提高餐饮企业对知识产权保护的认识及对品牌发展的规划，2024年11月8日，博望餐饮法务咨询团队邀请到<strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\">广东味方知识产权创始人甘德兴老师</strong>为三十余家餐饮人带来<strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(232, 87, 83); box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\">《餐饮企业如何最低成本做好品牌保护防止山寨》</span></strong>专题分享。此外<strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\">博望团队首席顾问马俊龙律师</strong>还为大家带来了<span style=\"color: rgb(232, 87, 83); box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\">《擅用连锁加盟撬动“百城千店”》</strong></span>主题分享。此次分享旨在让餐饮人了解知识产权保护对自身发展的重要性，同时帮助客户更好地维护其合法权益。本次活动由博望团队浦宝婧律师主持。</p></section><section style=\"margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 0; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%; vertical-align: middle; display: inline-block; line-height: 0; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.6666666666666666\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/jNSvMVkX72Iu6fWSBIWbkDkRr34FGDlEAGLWulyAAvQTfia1Dy0ibT3bicDtFdcQhcybWgzcTlx1NrWtib4fYm4LyQ/640?wx_fmt=png#imgIndex=2\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; max-width: 100%; width: 609.297px !important; box-sizing: border-box; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;\" width=\"100%\" data-original-style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-index=\"5\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/jNSvMVkX72Iu6fWSBIWbkDkRr34FGDlEAGLWulyAAvQTfia1Dy0ibT3bicDtFdcQhcybWgzcTlx1NrWtib4fYm4LyQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=2\" _width=\"100%\" alt=\"图片\" data-report-img-idx=\"3\" data-fail=\"0\"></section></section><section style=\"margin: 10px 0px 20px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\">